    "section_text": "Systems Engineering Minor A student who receives a bachelor of science degree in an accredited engineering program or Computer Science from Missouri S&T may receive a minor in Systems Engineering by completing 15 hours of the courses listed below: ENG MGT 2310 Introduction to System Engineering 3 ENG MGT 3320 Introduction to Project Management 3 SYS ENG 5101 System Engineering and Analysis 3 SYS ENG 5211 Computational Intelligence 3 SYS ENG 5281 Introduction to Probabilistic Risk Assessment 3",
    "section_html": "<div class=\"tab_content\" id=\"minortextcontainer\">\n<a name=\"minortext\"></a><h2>Systems Engineering Minor</h2> <p><span data-teams=\"true\">A student who receives a bachelor of science degree in an accredited engineering program or Computer Science from Missouri S&amp;T may receive a minor in Systems Engineering by completing 15 hours of the courses listed below:</span></p> <table class=\"sc_courselist\" width=\"100%\"><colgroup><col class=\"codecol\"/><col class=\"titlecol\"/><col align=\"char\" char=\".\" class=\"hourscol\"/></colgroup><tbody><tr class=\"even firstrow\"><td class=\"codecol\"><a class=\"bubblelink code\" href=\"/search/?P=ENG%20MGT%202310\" onclick=\"return showCourse(this, 'ENG MGT 2310');\" title=\"ENG MGT 2310\">ENG MGT 2310</a></td><td>Introduction to System Engineering</td><td class=\"hourscol\">3</td></tr> <tr class=\"odd\"><td class=\"codecol\"><a class=\"bubblelink code\" href=\"/search/?P=ENG%20MGT%203320\" onclick=\"return showCourse(this, 'ENG MGT 3320');\" title=\"ENG MGT 3320\">ENG MGT 3320</a></td><td>Introduction to Project Management</td><td class=\"hourscol\">3</td></tr> <tr class=\"even\"><td class=\"codecol\"><a class=\"bubblelink code\" href=\"/search/?P=SYS%20ENG%205101\" onclick=\"return showCourse(this, 'SYS ENG 5101');\" title=\"SYS ENG 5101\">SYS ENG 5101</a></td><td>System Engineering and Analysis</td><td class=\"hourscol\">3</td></tr> <tr class=\"odd\"><td class=\"codecol\"><a class=\"bubblelink code\" href=\"/search/?P=SYS%20ENG%205211\" onclick=\"return showCourse(this, 'SYS ENG 5211');\" title=\"SYS ENG 5211\">SYS ENG 5211</a></td><td>Computational Intelligence</td><td class=\"hourscol\">3</td></tr> <tr class=\"even lastrow\"><td class=\"codecol\"><a class=\"bubblelink code\" href=\"/search/?P=SYS%20ENG%205281\" onclick=\"return showCourse(this, 'SYS ENG 5281');\" title=\"SYS ENG 5281\">SYS ENG 5281</a></td><td>Introduction to Probabilistic Risk Assessment</td><td class=\"hourscol\">3</td></tr> </tbody></table>\n</div>"
